=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  keys login ---------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. SSH Login on the weak host, with the$
# item that opens the screen: 6, SSH keys.$
$
# SSH Login ####################################################$
$
  [+] SSH Login            + root disallowed$
  [+] SSH Auth             + key-only auth$
  [+] SSH Port             + non-default (2230)$
$
  SSH Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Root SSH Login       Disallowed$
   -  Password Login       Off$
   -  SSH Port             2230$
   -  Allowed Users        Anyone$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Allow root key-only  Root logs in by key alone$
   2) Password login on    Let passwords log in again$
   3) Change SSH port      Now 2230$
   6) SSH keys             6 keys, 4 to review$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-3, 6 or q]:$
$
$

